        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_HoneySyrup_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "A clay bowl of thick honey syrup steeped with dried herbs. A spoonful eases a chest or throat infection for a while."
    },
    "CardHelpSection": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_honey_syrup",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_HoneySyrup_CardHelpSection",
        "DefaultText": "<b>Made from:</b> 1 Honeycomb, 2 Dried Chamomile or 2 Dried Common Plantain, and a Clay Bowl (Medical tab).\n\n<b>Honeycomb:</b> take it from a beehive or a bee skep.\n\n<b>Uses:</b> Take a Spoonful to raise the Heather Effect, which slows a chest or throat infection. Three spoonfuls to a bowl; the empty bowl comes back. It stacks with heather tea and shares its cap."
    },
